{"task":"transcribe","language":"english","duration":25.079999923706055,"text":"Two small gold cups from a tomb near Sparta worked in relief with scenes that read like a comic strip. On one, men set nets and trap a wild bull, and it goes badly. On the other, a tame bull walks quietly beside a cow. They are two ways of getting what you want, force or cunning. Both were made in the 15th century B.C., hammered out from the back.","words":[{"word":"Two","start":0,"end":0.6399999856948853},{"word":"small","start":0.6399999856948853,"end":1.100000023841858},{"word":"gold","start":1.100000023841858,"end":1.440000057220459},{"word":"cups","start":1.440000057220459,"end":1.7400000095367432},{"word":"from","start":1.7400000095367432,"end":2},{"word":"a","start":2,"end":2.440000057220459},{"word":"tomb","start":2.440000057220459,"end":2.440000057220459},{"word":"near","start":2.440000057220459,"end":2.759999990463257},{"word":"Sparta","start":2.759999990463257,"end":3.140000104904175},{"word":"worked","start":3.140000104904175,"end":3.9600000381469727},{"word":"in","start":3.9600000381469727,"end":4.28000020980835},{"word":"relief","start":4.28000020980835,"end":4.519999980926514},{"word":"with","start":4.519999980926514,"end":4.820000171661377},{"word":"scenes","start":4.820000171661377,"end":5.199999809265137},{"word":"that","start":5.199999809265137,"end":5.460000038146973},{"word":"read","start":5.460000038146973,"end":5.699999809265137},{"word":"like","start":5.699999809265137,"end":5.880000114440918},{"word":"a","start":5.880000114440918,"end":6.340000152587891},{"word":"comic","start":6.340000152587891,"end":6.340000152587891},{"word":"strip","start":6.340000152587891,"end":6.639999866485596},{"word":"On","start":7.400000095367432,"end":7.5},{"word":"one","start":7.5,"end":7.880000114440918},{"word":"men","start":8.460000038146973,"end":8.5600004196167},{"word":"set","start":8.5600004196167,"end":8.899999618530273},{"word":"nets","start":8.899999618530273,"end":9.199999